  "instructions": [
    "preheat the robata grill to 400°f (200°c).",
    "brush the dough with egg wash and place on a baking sheet.",
    "roasta-grill the dough for 10 minutes on each side, or until golden brown.",
    "place the blackberries on the dough, leaving a 1-inch border around the edges.",
    "fold the edges of the dough up over the blackberries, pressing gently to seal.",
    "brush the top of the galette with the cream and sprinkle with sugar.",
    "roasta-grill the galette for an additional 10 minutes, or until the cream is golden brown.",
    "allow the galette to cool for 5 minutes before slicing and serving."
